### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Catalog
GET http://localhost:3000/products
GET http://localhost:3000/products/p-monitor

### Create cart and add limited-stock item
POST http://localhost:3000/carts
Content-Type: application/json

###
@cartId = {{carts.response.body.data.id}}

POST http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "p-cable",
  "quantity": 2
}

GET http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}

PUT http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}/items/p-cable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### Checkout (retry this request with the same Idempotency-Key)
POST http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-0001

{}

### Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/admin/coupons/generate
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/report
